{"time": 1772620449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317359808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#拿出灯前进吧"}
{"time": 1772620468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640705108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你点燃了灯火，进去之后亮度却超出你的预期，山洞内壁都是亮晶晶的冰面，不知道究竟是挂了霜，还是墙壁原本就是冰块，总之火光在里面无限反射，亮如白昼"}
{"time": 1772620475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104461971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（爽爽素材复用）"}
{"time": 1772620485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28098517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "山洞中央有一根顶天立地的冰柱，高有大概四米，直径也有接近两米，也许是和钟乳石类似的原理"}
{"time": 1772620507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014300623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（老婆！）"}
{"time": 1772620514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448407985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "😋"}
